WEBVTT

00:11:27.971 --> 00:11:31.220
how to provide rescue breaths,
should this happen again.

00:11:31.244 --> 00:11:33.577
And left him with a bag valve mask.

00:11:34.236 --> 00:11:35.736
Positive change.

00:11:36.466 --> 00:11:37.847
Positive change.

00:11:38.585 --> 00:11:40.735
Did I happen to mention

00:11:40.759 --> 00:11:44.084
the two things that firefighters
dislike the most?

00:11:44.965 --> 00:11:47.712
The way things are and change.

00:11:47.736 --> 00:11:53.994
(Laughter)

00:11:54.299 --> 00:11:57.946
You know, I recognize that there have been
drug epidemics before.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:12:01.170
And I've seen what crack
can do to a community.